cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this database or software, please cite it as below."
title: "AMED Research Database: a searchable database, REST API, and MCP server for AMED-funded research projects"
abstract: >-
  A searchable database and API for research proposals accepted by AMED (Japan
  Agency for Medical Research and Development). Ships a pre-built SQLite
  database of 3,816 projects, 3,013 researchers, 741 institutions, and 214
  funding programs compiled from AMED's public listings (2015-2025), together
  with a FastAPI REST service, analytics endpoints, an MCP server for LLM
  clients, and a PDF summary report. The source code is MIT licensed; the
  compiled database and the report are released under CC BY 4.0 (see
  LICENSE-DATA).
type: software
